{
    "title": "BritBox: Brilliant British TV",
    "description": "Created by the BBC, BritBox allows you to stream the biggest collection of British TV \u2014 all in one place.\r\nChoose from a world-class library featuring an impressive variety of genres including mysteries, dramas, comedies, lifestyle, documentaries and more.\r\nStart your free 7-day trial and stream ad-free across all your favorite devices.\r\nWith BritBox, you\u2019ll get:\r\n- Weekly premieres including new & exclusive series, so there's always something to watch\r\n- Exclusive new seasons of fan-favorites like Vera, Shetland, Grace, Silent Witness and more\r\n- Exciting Original series like Payback, The Cleaner, The Tower, Stonehouse, The Confessions of Frannie Langton, Karen Pirie, and Sister Boniface Mysteries\r\n- The biggest collection of Agatha Christie anywhere, including BritBox's original adaptation of Why Didn't They Ask Evans?, plus full series of classics like Marple, Poirot and much more\r\nDownload the BritBox app and start streaming today!\r\nContact us at support@britbox.com if you are experiencing any issues or have feedback.\r\nBritBox Privacy Policy:\r\nhttps://www.britbox.com/privacy\r\nBritBox Terms of Use:\r\nhttps://www.britbox.com/terms-and-conditions",
    "descriptionHTML": "Created by the BBC, BritBox allows you to stream the biggest collection of British TV \u2014 all in one place.<br>Choose from a world-class library featuring an impressive variety of genres including mysteries, dramas, comedies, lifestyle, documentaries and more.<br>Start your free 7-day trial and stream ad-free across all your favorite devices.<br>With BritBox, you\u2019ll get:<br>- Weekly premieres including new &amp; exclusive series, so there&#39;s always something to watch<br>- Exclusive new seasons of fan-favorites like Vera, Shetland, Grace, Silent Witness and more<br>- Exciting Original series like Payback, The Cleaner, The Tower, Stonehouse, The Confessions of Frannie Langton, Karen Pirie, and Sister Boniface Mysteries<br>- The biggest collection of Agatha Christie anywhere, including BritBox&#39;s original adaptation of Why Didn&#39;t They Ask Evans?, plus full series of classics like Marple, Poirot and much more<br>Download the BritBox app and start streaming today!<br>Contact us at support@britbox.com if you are experiencing any issues or have feedback.<br>BritBox Privacy Policy:<br>https://www.britbox.com/privacy<br>BritBox Terms of Use:<br>https://www.britbox.com/terms-and-conditions",
